    "backstory": "Growing up in the Bldg Luchadas gave \"Knuckles\" Mallard a knack for navigating the city's underbelly and a healthy respect for masked mayhem. He saw the writing on the wall long before the DRIP dried up, and spent his time learning to spot the best opportunities, legal or otherwise.",
